    "name": "SCP: CB Multiplayer Reborn",
    "steam_appid": 3257000,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257000/extras/6bdcf204f3fd27dafb5781d05162fd7a.avif?t=1754733111\" width=612 height=76 /></span><strong><i>Welcome to the SCP Facility!</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a thrilling and immersive horror experience based on the SCP universe. Choose from multiple roles, including scientists, Class-D personnel, various SCPs, facility guards, MTF operatives, and Chaos Insurgency members!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>SCP: CB Multiplayer Reborn</i>, a wide range of terrifying adventures awaits. Immerse yourself in a highly atmospheric, suspense-filled world where every corner holds new dangers, and every decision could mean life or death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257000/extras/757b55b01ff093ea5b055189995457f3.avif?t=1754733111\" width=612 height=76 /></span><strong>Experience the Full Story in Single-Player or Multiplayer Co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Story Mode</i>, a thrilling experience you can enjoy <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>with friends</strong>. As a Class-D test subject, escape the site during a facility-wide breach, encountering some of the SCP Foundation\u2019s most dangerous entities and navigating endless corridors. With multiple possible endings, your choices shape your journey as you uncover secrets, evade threats, and strive for survival in the chaos. Can you emerge unscathed, or will the horrors lurking within get the better of you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257000/extras/5805f8af7d790941b53286bb1df8bf4a.avif?t=1754733111\" width=612 height=76 /></span><strong>Fight for Survival or Control in PvP Breach Mode!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>PvP Breach Mode</i>, take on various roles\u2014whether as Class-D personnel, a scientist, a guard, an elite MTF unit, or even a member of the Chaos Insurgency. This mode features randomized map generation, making each playthrough a unique experience. Form alliances, cooperate, or betray others in a high-stakes setting where every interaction can lead to intense, dynamic scenarios. Can you survive or secure the facility against other players from around the world?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257000/extras/6bdcf204f3fd27dafb5781d05162fd7a.avif?t=1754733111\" width=612 height=76 /></span><strong><i>Welcome to the SCP Facility!</i></strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a thrilling and immersive horror experience based on the SCP universe. Choose from multiple roles, including scientists, Class-D personnel, various SCPs, facility guards, MTF operatives, and Chaos Insurgency members!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>SCP: CB Multiplayer Reborn</i>, a wide range of terrifying adventures awaits. Immerse yourself in a highly atmospheric, suspense-filled world where every corner holds new dangers, and every decision could mean life or death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257000/extras/757b55b01ff093ea5b055189995457f3.avif?t=1754733111\" width=612 height=76 /></span><strong>Experience the Full Story in Single-Player or Multiplayer Co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Story Mode</i>, a thrilling experience you can enjoy <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>with friends</strong>. As a Class-D test subject, escape the site during a facility-wide breach, encountering some of the SCP Foundation\u2019s most dangerous entities and navigating endless corridors. With multiple possible endings, your choices shape your journey as you uncover secrets, evade threats, and strive for survival in the chaos. Can you emerge unscathed, or will the horrors lurking within get the better of you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257000/extras/5805f8af7d790941b53286bb1df8bf4a.avif?t=1754733111\" width=612 height=76 /></span><strong>Fight for Survival or Control in PvP Breach Mode!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>PvP Breach Mode</i>, take on various roles\u2014whether as Class-D personnel, a scientist, a guard, an elite MTF unit, or even a member of the Chaos Insurgency. This mode features randomized map generation, making each playthrough a unique experience. Form alliances, cooperate, or betray others in a high-stakes setting where every interaction can lead to intense, dynamic scenarios. Can you survive or secure the facility against other players from around the world?</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive the chaos of SCP Foundation! Step into a thrilling SCP horror experience with story-driven co-op, intense PvP Breach mode, and randomized maps. Play as Class-D, scientist, SCPs, and more, each role bringing unique challenges in an unpredictable, immersive facility.",
