    "legal_notice": "\"SCP: CB Multiplayer Reborn\" is an independent, fan-made project built on SCP: CB Ultimate Edition Reborn, developed by Ultimate Edition Team. It is based on SCP - Containment Breach, originally created by Undertow Games and Third Subdivision Studios. This game is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License (CC BY-SA 3.0).<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis project utilizes DirectX for graphics and FMOD as its sound engine. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the SCP Foundation or any related entities. All SCP content is derived from the SCP Foundation Wiki under the terms of the CC BY-SA 3.0 license.",
